    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w06.asset.sprite.mimi.tsukkomi",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "リバイバル公演の初日は、拍子抜けするほど大入りだった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "演目「先付け、四十二点」——去年の、うちの初戦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "自分たちの再演を、自分たちで観に行く。妙な座組で、客席に並んだ。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "幕が開いて、役者さん演じる「ミミ」が出てきた。衣装が完璧だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "兎の耳の角度まで、完璧だった。……思わず、自分の耳を触った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "偽ミミが見得を切る。「初心者です。監督が」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——場内、爆笑。本人の隣で。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "仲間たちが変な声で笑い、私も笑いながら、座席に深く沈んだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.003d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.003d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……自分の名場面は、正面から観るものじゃない。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.direction.mimi.shift.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w06.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "笑って観ていた。途中までは。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "役者さんたちは、上手い。上手いのに——どこか手順をなぞる目をしてる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "去年あの砂の上にあった「次がどうなるか誰も知らない」が、板の上には、無い。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "波の大道具が、仕掛けの泡文字を掲げた。「せんつけ 42てん」客席から拍手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……本物のあの泡は、生きて、選んで、点を付けてたのに。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "作り物の泡は、毎晩同じ点を掲げるんだろう。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "幕間、隣の席の剣士さんが、ぽつりと言った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「よく出来とる。……出来すぎとって、寂しいのう」同じことを感じてる人が、隣にいた。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "終演後、楽屋へ見舞いに行った。役者さんに罪はない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "むしろ立派な仕事だ。役者の「ミミ」さんが、目を輝かせて喜んだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「ご本人に観ていただけるなんて! 明日から、もっと寄せます!」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.007d",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.007d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……寄せなくていいです。今ので満点です。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——その楽屋の、衣装棚の上。見てしまった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "黒い、角封筒。赤い封蝋。宛名は「座長殿」役者さんたちは、まだ誰も気づいていない。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰り道は、静かだった。会社は、自分で立ち上げた再演の座組にすら、あの封筒を出す。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w06.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……この公演の裏で、何が数えられてるんだろう。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "main.s2.w06.choice.001",
          "label": "翌朝、座長に封筒のことを伝えに行く",
          "result": "見て見ぬふりは、性に合わない。翌朝、座長さんに伝えた。「……うちの一座にも、来ましたか」封筒は、この街でよく知られた不幸の形らしい。「困ったときは、おたくの受付に?」どうぞ。うちが、この街でいちばん正式です。",
          "intent": "見てしまった不幸を、放置しない",
          "promise": "一座との縁ができる代わりに、会社の内情に一歩踏み込む",
          "memory": "座長の「うちの一座にも、来ましたか」が手帳に残る",
          "tone": "heroic",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "sharedPoints",
              "amount": 2
            }
          ],
          "goto": "main.s2.w06.node.end.001"
        },
        {
          "id": "main.s2.w06.choice.002",
          "label": "まず、封筒の宛先の意味を調べる",
          "result": "動く前に、知る。ノノさんと洗った、座組封筒の前例。大抵「演目の差し替え」か「上演権の回収」だ。差し替え先はまだ分からない。ただ、嫌な予感の形はもう知ってる。「世界滅亡ショー」の四文字が浮かぶ。……考えすぎであってほしい。",
          "intent": "善意で動く前に、事実を揃える",
          "promise": "先が読める代わりに、動き出しは一歩遅れる",
          "memory": "座組封筒の前例(差し替え/回収)の控えが増えた",
          "tone": "pragmatic",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "sharedPoints",
              "amount": 2
            }
          ],
          "goto": "main.s2.w06.node.end.001"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s2.w06.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
  "debug": {
